_Nayotake_ (in English "Supple Bamboo")
is the 12th track of the animated film _The Tale of Princess Kaguya_ (2013).
The leitmotif recurs throughout the film.

_The Tale of Princess Kaguya_ is based on the 10th-century folk tale _The Tale of the Bamboo Cutter_.
With a budget of US\$49.3 million, it was the most expensive Japanese film
ever made.
